M09_Elevator_All_Controller escort guard for the three one-way lifts
(1265150 via controller 2000491, 1265149 via 2000580, 1265126 via 2000587;
Direction 0 only, no return controller). If the car does not carry Mobius
(rider separation at low frame rates), nothing in the original scripts can
bring him up and the escort cannot finish. After the ride (10 s sim time,
ride <= 4.7 s), compare Z levels against the controller's own authored
points (Waypoint_num = origin, Mobius_exit_goto = destination). Only when
Havoc is at the destination level and Mobius is still at the origin level,
teleport Mobius to Mobius_exit_goto and send the original ELEVATOR_EXIT
resume. Re-checks every 5 s (6 checks) while Havoc is not yet up. At most
16 breadcrumbs per process. A carried Mobius, other lifts and Direction 1
controllers are unchanged.

